","\"-171.1229\"","\"-161.0640\"","\"-62.0980\"","\"207.8024\"","\"-26.4862\"","\"49.3718\"","\"-10.9013\"","\"-1.8007\"","\"5.1925\"","\"6.8662\"","\"-16.0892\"","\"36.6698\"","\"196.0215\"","\"197.1591\"","\"147.016125\"","\"0.121109360913010021790078975138375571\"","\"0.0879634154199653341607170817498674861\"","\"-0.289236547080504527253605811197532951\"","\"-43.6022\"","\"79.5225649555471441950061397008517391\"","\"unit\"","\"interim\"","\"reconciliations\"","\"cashflow_vintages\"","\".5173552\"","\".9371\"","\".2419\"","\".6983\"","\".1694\"","\"latest_verified\"","\"h1_fy27\"","\"h2_fy26_revenue\"","\"h2_fy25_revenue\"","\"source\"","\"2026-03-31 FY26\"","\"ND at cutoff, no annualization\"","\"990.12\"","\"759.01\"","\"Ind AS comparative rolling half-year revenue only; cash not published for this half alone\"","\"issue\"","\"details\"","\"Consolidation\"","\"FY25 revenue 1107.4363 and PAT93.3663 original proportionate consolidation become 1072.0680 and 96.6322 under Ind AS equity method. FY26 comparisons use only the latter. Prior standalone EPC revenues excluded LLP sales, so revenue trend economically cross-checks but not a formal six-year Ind AS series.\"","\"PreIPO cash-flow classifications\"","\"FY24 original CFO-25.3843; IPO restated CFO-14.6624 plus noncurrent-asset investing outflow 10.7217 nearly reproduces original cash drain. FY25 original report re-presents FY24 CFO-22.1081. FY21 original cash 33.4618537 includes banks/deposits while FY22 comparative reports 8.3610. Do not splice or cumulatively sum these as a fully comparable cash series.\"","\"IPO proceeds\"","\"Fresh issue 93.4650; cash flow net 85.3825 (8.0825 share issue expenses), whereas objects allocation net 77.9693 deducts 15.4957 overall issue costs. OFS67.00 is sellers’ money, not issuer financing. ₹25.1093 residual parked in CC reduces borrowing rather than establishing an extra free cash account. Fee allocation/timing difference unresolved, retained explicitly.\"","\"JV cash flow adju