770604856377416266072\"","\"0.18\"","\"70.6617208846421198715839605831713361\"","\"76.3171781605236308821268236626823148\"","\"audit_history\"","\"critical_findings\"","\"governance_gate\"","\"financial_reliability_gate\"","\"main_pdf_pages\"","\"caro_pdf_pages\"","\"ifc_pdf_pages\"","\"opinion\"","\"ifc\"","\"reviewed\"","\"findings\"","\"29–34\"","\"35–38\"","\"39–41\"","\"Unmodified\"","\"Adequate and effective opinion\"","\"Original full audit with CARO and IFC, not only restatement examination\"","\"On-demand related loans; 2.25 cr Sarthak guarantee; no default/fraud reported.\"","\"35–41\"","\"42–44\"","\"Loan schedule wording conflicts with all-loans on-demand wording; 4.42 cr loans/2.25 cr guarantee; preferential allotment boilerplate not matched to changed share capital.\"","\"31–36\"","\"37–43\"","\"44–46\"","\"Same loan-terms contradiction; 11.24 cr loans and 2.25 cr Sarthak guarantee; no default/fraud reported.\"","\"41–47\"","\"48–54\"","\"55–57\"","\"Loans 11.9682 cr; guarantees 49.20 cr; loan-term contradiction persists; tax dispute 0.52 lakh; audit trail operated. No severe misconduct established.\"","\"standalone_printed_pages\"","\"consolidated_printed_pages\"","\"71–77\"","\"109–114\"","\"Unmodified; IPO and HKRP conversion emphasis of matter\"","\"IPO utilization/purpose table read; working capital returns agree; no default/fraud/resignation reported; income-tax dispute 285.45 lakh and TDS14.26 lakh later reduced. Proportionate joint-control consolidation not comparable to FY26 equity method without bridge.\"","\"118–129\"","\"192–201\"","\"Unmodified, first Ind AS emphasis; EPC input-method revenue KAM\"","\"Adequate/effective; audittrail operated and preserved\"","\"Auditor change mandatory rotation, not resignation. Main auditor relies on subsidiary/JV other auditors; subsidiaryloss 2.79 lakh, JVprofit 569.11 lakh. CARO no default, no reported fraud, returns agree. IPO25.1093 cr parked inCC, not separate available cash. Book cash profit/no cash loss is not positive CFO.\"","\"Original FY22/23 financial statement footers contain an inconsistent CIN; verified legal identity against prospectus, current AR and exchange ISIN. Not silently accepted as another issuer.\"","\"PreIPO audit loan-term clauses conflict; term certainty not inferred from auditor non-overdue statement. FY26 agreements explicitly defer related loan repayment beyond 31 March 2028.\"","\"No restrictive cash released and no co-guarantee automatically charged as paid debt.\"","\"Missing 60-session market data and current drawdown terms limit investment classification, not audit history retrieval.\"","\"Conditional, not Fail\"","\"Conditional; current IndAS statements readable and material restatement reconciled, old classifications remain separate\"","\"id\"","\"url\"","\"bytes\"","\"format\"","\"source_id\"","\"evidence_type\"","\"sections_used\"","\"retrieved_date\"","\"redistribution\"","\"https://www.rajeshpower.com/img/Annual-Report-for-F.Y.2020-21.pdf\"","1900306","\"020ce8d653f3c3aff6653aba5716702e0cfa768852f05c8bb21b5928e3221473\"","\".pdf\"","\"V: historical/contract disclosure; management outlook is M\"","\"Original audit and CARO/IFC PDF29–41; financials42–44; FY20 comparative\"","\"2026-10-23\"","\"Original documents and extraction files excluded from deliverable; authored factual extracts only\"","\"https://www.rajeshpower.com/img/Annual-Report-for-F.Y.2021-22.pdf\"","13205828","\"fbf36fb3268d9c491bd6ad2a806813298159fa5849f195cecfdd677e3daaad86\"","\"Original audit/CARO/IFC PDF29–44; financials45–47; notes\"","\"https://www.rajeshpower.com/img/Annual-Report-for-F.Y.2022-23.pdf\"","4866377","\"47e4f6d75f7b902be38f6930978039b5993fb3713a39b1140893b6883da391b3\"","\"Original audit/CARO/IFC PDF31–46; financials47–49; notes\"","\"https://www.rajeshpower.com/img/Annual-Report-for-F.Y.2023-24.pdf\"","14534618","\"ba3bf059e96e6d7725e9c276f564616b6a11f7eec79e1a592be7aea5a9f29ac9\"","\"Original audit/CARO/IFC PDF41–57; financials58–60; not