\"","\"sales\"","\"margins\"","\"ar_ratio\"","\"retention_ratio\"","\"inventory_ratio\"","\"payable_ratio\"","\"advance_ratio\"","\"other_net_ratio\"","\"restricted_ratio\"","\"epc_fixed_ratio\"","\"bess_total_capex\"","\"bess_delay_months\"","\"bess_annual_opex\"","\"bess_annual_maintenance\"","\"guarantee_call\"","\"co_guarantee_call\"","\"ar_writeoff\"","\"retention_writeoff\"","\"debt_due_month\"","\"promoter_due_month\"","\"1450\"","\".075\"","\"1370\"","\"1440\"","\"1550\"","\"1650\"","\".07\"","\".08\"","\".27\"","\".22\"","\".09\"","\".16\"","\".012\"","\".005\"","\".055\"","\".018\"","\"162.5\"","12","\"4.0\"","\"1.5\"","\"30.45921\"","\"19.8437\"","\"17.438605\"","\"13.971745\"","18","\"1800\"","\".115\"","\"2000\"","\"2280\"","\"2550\"","\"2800\"","\"3000\"","\".11\"","\".19\"","\".20\"","\".015\"","\".003\"","\".05\"","\"130\"","0","\"1.0\"","24","\".125\"","\"2200\"","\"2700\"","\"3250\"","\"3800\"","\"4300\"","\".12\"","\".17\"","\".14\"","\".21\"","\".017\"","\".045\"","\".013\"","\"97.5\"","\"2.5\"","\".8\"","36","\"period_ends\"","\"days\"","\"bess_spend_each_full_month\"","\"dividend_date\"","\"dividend\"","\"tax_liability_cash\"","\"tax_payment_period\"","\"front_received_fraction\"","\"2026-04-30\"","\"2026-05-31\"","\"2026-06-30\"","\"2026-07-31\"","\"2026-08-31\"","\"2026-09-30\"","30","31","19","\"2.0\"","\"1.8007392\"","\".70\"","\"All monthly operations, timing and BESS deployment are analyst counterfactuals. No interim balance sheet/cash verification at entry. IPO residual is NOT added as cash; pre-entry failure cannot be repaired later.\"","\"mw\"","\"monthly_tariff_lakh_per_mw\"","\"contract_years\"","\"expected_start_month_after_entry\"","\"annual_replacement_reserve\"","\"replacement_year_from_commissioning\"","\"replacement_cost\"","\"salvage\"","\"tariff_escalation\"","\"subsidy\"","\"potential_vgf\"","\"potential_vgf_source\"","\"potential_vgf_status\"","\"vgf_bg_face\"","\"performance_bg_face\"","\"contractual_cod_reference\"","\"financial_closure_reference\"","\"assumed_financial_closure\"","\"tariff_timing_convention\"","\"65\"","\"1.89\"","11","\"30\"","\"Finite twelve-year BESPA; no verified escalator or bank commitment. Original RfS specifies potential VGF and performance conditions. Base zero grant receipts is a conservative funding assumption, not ineligibility. No EPC profit on own project. Delay over nine months is modeled as termination with sunk capital and zero future tariff, absent an extension.\"","\"23.4\"","\"Eligible Phase VII RfS framework; issuer sanction and certification not verified. Base zero receipts, conditional 20/50/30 branch with 3- and 12-month government disbursement lags.\"","\"8.125\"","\"2027-09-06\"","\"2026-12-06\"","\"2026-11-19\"","\"Exact actual-day allocation of 144 contractual monthly periods from 6 September 2027 into reporting buckets ending on the 19th. No tariff before COD; each monthly tariff, depreciation, maintenance and operating cost uses the same fraction. Dates are original-RfS-derived and signed deviations remain ND.\"","\"ordinary_new_debt\"","\"optional_bank_gross_limit\"","\"optional_bank_interest\"","\"optional_bank_tenor_years\"","\"optional_bank_maturity_policy\"","\"optional_equity_gross_limit\"","\"optional_equity_price\"","\"optional_equity_fee\"","\"optional_new_shares_limit\"","\"preentry_rescue_allowed\"","\"priority\"","\"No automatic renewal; amortize from24 months after first draw over36months, all remaining deducted in terminal equity\"","\"657.48\"","\".03\"","6992608","\"Post-entry bank headroom up to100cr then whole-share equity within100cr/authorized-share bounds; bank and equity are hypothetical uncommitted. No post-entry rescue cures a pre-entry breach.\"","\"All scenario and sensitivity inputs are A, not management promises or observed current balances.\"","\"Debt obligations are conservative scenario run-off schedules, not inferred contractual maturities; actual callable facilities require renewal. Promoter debt becomes repayable after31March2028.\"","\"No restricted deposits released into available cash, including at terminal; growing guarantee support consumes cash, declining sales do not automatically release collateral.\"","\"Reported unspent IPO25.1093cr is a deployment earmark parked in CC, not an additional starting cash asset.\"","\"Discount-rate grid is a risk-adjusted nominal-INR analytical sensitivity; not an empirically estimated WACC or automatic use of the equity hurdle.\"","\"Existing JV is valued separately once at conservative carrying value; no JV profit in EPC cashflows or EPC terminal. Loans6.2417 are valued separately with haircuts, not assumed operating cash collections.\"","\"Annual dividends after entry zero: retained cash enters equity only once; historical FY26 dividend paid before entry is not an investor distribution.\"","\"Loss tax benefits are not monetized. Rental expenses remain operating expenses; no separately reported material lease claim is invented.\"","\"Default cash floor1cr is operational assumption, tested separately at5cr and10cr; it is not a reported covenant.\"","\"The INR 1 crore audited plant-and-machinery CWIP is not identified as BESS in note 4. Allocation to BESS is A, tested at zero with the full amount retained in EPC capital.\"","\"Bear generic bank-guarantee call is 10% of ₹312.7171 crore excluding the separately stressed ₹8.125 crore BESS PBG: ₹30.45921 crore. This assumes that pre-BESPA PBG is within March total BG, so the same face exposure is not charged twice.\"","\"paths\"","\"tests\"","\"reverse_tests\"","\"unique_paths\"","\"test_references\"","\"deduplication\"","\"p_d274e9ea3c7233c8\"","\"p_ccbde5c4f6a064ba\"","\"p_594cb5fff10b2aa4\"","\"p_bdddc83607dcb403\"","\"p_cb83e1b666d46f02\"","\"p_82dd1cd01b0396bb\"","\"p_a53fcdeb6341b1a0\"","\"p_26e2c64437b56d0b\"","\"p_420407d8ad7cc750\"","\"p_46925f0390cf66c0\"","\"p_f6fe4e6b8194ab48\"","\"p_96da09f57fa8349e\"","\"p_9709920620bc44e8\"","\"p_be5a89691fb8773a\"","\"p_90a4a276